# Copy to .env for local development. .env is gitignored.
#
# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# Get one by entering your destination email at https://web3forms.com — they mail
# the key straight back. Set the same value in Cloudflare Pages under
# Settings → Environment variables, then redeploy.
#
# This key is PUBLIC by design: it is embedded in the page source of every
# Web3Forms site. The env var exists so there is a single place to change it,
# not to keep it secret. Do not put anything actually sensitive behind PUBLIC_.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
